@appeal
subtitle: The historical choice. Moscow approves, the Left grumbles. · dev: trust +4, workers_kpd +1×m, kf_left_dissent +2
on-arrival: comintern_trust += 4; workers_kpd += 1*campaign_mult; kf_left_dissent += 2
